message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "AI-Based Environmental Data Analysis and Interpretation: From Campus Sensor Readings to Evidence and Action (NOKTA Workshop, ÜNİDES 2026)"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual (English and Turkish) materials of a two-hour workshop for the NOKTA
  project: an interactive site with 3D scenes, a Colab notebook and a synthetic
  dataset that follows the NOKTA field protocol. Participants clean low-cost
  sensor data, compare measurement points fairly, discover microclimates with
  unsupervised learning, explain a random forest under an honest test and write
  AI-assisted reports with a number audit.
type: software
